title: No source I found describes a team of specialists that keep nothing but notes and work one at a time.
pid: 9643144f-9b7c-4b08-a702-d2f3f7c41e65
body: |2-
  Every source assumes people who remember, or one orchestrator that
  runs throughout. So each step that rests on "ours" is untested
  anywhere; the trials above are the test.
